FCC approval for up to 1 million orbital ai satellites lets SpaceX test constant solar compute beyond ground power and water limits. This is SpaceX Daily Episode 174. Musk on the competitive gap, a classified lift from vandenberg, and the Cochise County campus, then the counterpoint and the engineering deep dive. SpaceX, spaceflight now reports, now holds the first license of this type for an ai compute network in orbit. And the star mine grant does not require

