00:00:54.540 --> 00:01:00.280
two kilometers. In 50 kilometer thick shells at 30 degree and sun-synchronous inclinations

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:05.960
that hold a steady sun angle, taking power from the sun, dumping waste heat by radiation,

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:11.400
and sending finished compute over star links optical cross links. First flight could come

