00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.560
backs American leadership in superintelligence infrastructure

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:33.180
while Amazon's Kuiper, VSAT,

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.280
and the American Astronomical Society

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.980
objected over orbital debris, congestion

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:40.320
and harm to optical and radio astronomy.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.400
Elon Musk replied on X that the constellation

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.020
will be a great asset to America and the world.

00:01:46.997 --> 00:01:48.917
Musk wrote in a separate post on X

00:01:48.917 --> 00:01:51.197
that SpaceX is beating the rest of the world

00:01:51.197 --> 00:01:54.977
