00:02:13.052 --> 00:02:17.992
Cochise County's super compute campus will use neither a gas plant nor an industrial water

00:02:17.992 --> 00:02:23.872
draw. SpaceX set on X, and it relies on closed-loop dry cooling that keeps coolant in the pipes

